#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:48
msgid "Applies a kaleidoscope effect."
msgstr "Aplikuje kaleidoskopický efekt."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:52
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:59
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:60
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:62
msgid "Specify Source Segment"
msgstr "Určiť zdrojový segment"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:63
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:69
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:75
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:78
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Prepnúť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:64
msgid ""
"If **on**, the source angle is read from :guilabel:`Source segment`, "
"otherwise auto-calculated"
msgstr ""
"Ak je **zap.**, zdrojový uhol sa číta z :guilabel:`Zdrojový segment`, inak "
"sa automaticky vypočíta"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:65
msgid "Segmentation Direction"
msgstr "Smer segmentácie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:66
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:72
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Výber"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:67
msgid ""
"Options are **None**, **Counter clockwise**, and **Clockwise** (default)"
msgstr ""
"Možnosti sú **Žiadne**, **Proti smeru hodinových ručičiek** a **Po smere "
"hodinových ručičiek** (predvolené)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:68
msgid "Reflect Edges"
msgstr "Odraziť hrany"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:70
msgid ""
"If **on**, then reflections that end up outside the source reflect back into "
"it, otherwise the specified background color is used"
msgstr ""
"Ak je **zap.**, odrazy, ktoré skončia mimo zdroja, sa odrazia späť do neho, "
"inak sa použije zadaná farba pozadia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:71
msgid "Preferred Corner"
msgstr "Preferovaný roh"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:73
msgid ""
"Options are **Top right** (default), **Top left**, **Bottom left**, and "
"**bottom right**"
msgstr ""
"Možnosti sú **Vpravo hore** (predvolené), **Vľavo hore**, **Vľavo dole** a "
"**Vpravo dole**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:74
msgid "Corner Search"
msgstr "Hľadanie rohu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:76
msgid ""
"If **on**, search clockwise for furthest corner, otherwise counter clockwise"
msgstr ""
"Ak je **zap.**, hľadá najvzdialenejší roh po smere hodinových ručičiek, inak "
"proti smeru hodinových ručičiek"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:77
msgid "No Alpha Background"
msgstr "Bez alfa pozadia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:79
msgid ""
"If reflection lies outside of source image and not reflecting back in, the "
"selected color is used. Default is **On**."
msgstr ""
"Ak odraz leží mimo zdrojového obrazu a neodráža sa späť, použije sa vybraná "
"farba. Predvolene **Zap.**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:80
msgid "Origin X"
msgstr "Počiatok X"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:81
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:84
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:87
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:90
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:93
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:82
msgid ""
"X-coordinate of the origin of the kaleidoscope. Default **50** (center)."
msgstr "Súradnica X počiatku kaleidoskopu. Predvolene **50** (stred)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:83
msgid "Origin Y"
msgstr "Počiatok Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:85
msgid ""
"Y-coordinate of the origin of the kaleidoscope. Default **50** (center)."
msgstr "Súradnica Y počiatku kaleidoskopu. Predvolene **50** (stred)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:86
msgid "Segmentation"
msgstr "Segmentácia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:88
msgid ""
"Kaleidoscope segmentation / 128. Segmentations of 1, 2 or multiples of 4 "
"work best. Default **16** (16/128 = 0.125)"
msgstr ""
"Segmentácia kaleidoskopu / 128. Segmentácie 1, 2 alebo násobky 4 fungujú "
"najlepšie. Predvolene **16** (16/128 = 0.125)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:89
msgid "Source Segment"
msgstr "Zdrojový segment"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:91
msgid ""
"Centre of source segment if :guilabel:`Specify source segment` is **on**. 0 "
"is in +x and rotates counter clockwise"
msgstr ""
"Stred zdrojového segmentu ak je :guilabel:`Určiť zdrojový segment` **zap.**. "
"0 je v +x a otáča sa proti smeru hodinových ručičiek"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:92
msgid "Edge Threshold"
msgstr "Prah hrany"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:94
msgid ""
"Edge threshold / 4, reflections outside the image but within this distance "
"clamp to the edge. Default is **0**"
msgstr ""
"Prah hrany / 4, odrazy mimo obrazu, ale v tejto vzdialenosti sa upnú na "
"hranu. Predvolene **0**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:95
msgid "Background Color"
msgstr "Farba pozadia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:96
msgid "Picker"
msgstr "Výberník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/stylize/kaleid0sc0pe.rst:97
msgid ""
"Color to use if reflection lies outside of source image and not reflecting "
"back in (:guilabel:`Reflect edges` is **off**). Default is pink."
msgstr ""
"Farba, ktorá sa použije ak odraz leží mimo zdrojového obrazu a neodráža sa "
"späť (:guilabel:`Odraziť hrany` je **vyp.**). Predvolene ružová."

